  "label": "Nancy Pelosi is mapped as the embodiment of the political platform described in the text",
  "description": "The text 'our platform is simple: regain power, destroy the economy, impeach trump' is overlaid on the image of Nancy Pelosi. This creates an analogical mapping where Nancy Pelosi (the visual entity) is being presented as the person or figure who represents or embodies this satirical political platform. The meme implies that Pelosi is the one who is advocating for or responsible for this platform, even though the text is presented as a satirical summary of her actions or motives. The mapping is established through the direct juxtaposition of her image with the text that attributes these specific political goals to her.",
